## Configurable parameters reference (set by customer at deployment)

| Parameter | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|
| SCAN_FREQUENCY | Daily 02:00 | Cron schedule for automated runs |
| RISK_HORIZON_DAYS | 60 | Days ahead to scan for expiring batches |
| DEMAND_HORIZON_DAYS | 90 | IBP forecast window for consumption projection |
| RESIDUAL_QTY_THRESHOLD | 10% | Min residual % to still flag a partially-covered batch |
| RESIDUAL_QTY_ABSOLUTE | 50 units | Min absolute residual qty to flag |
| MIN_RISK_QTY | 0 | Min net risk qty to include in report |
| MIN_SCORE_THRESHOLD | 20 | Min risk score to surface in report |
| W_EXPIRY / W_EXPOSURE / W_VALUE / W_BIN | 40/30/20/10 | Risk score weights (must sum to 100) |
| MIN_SHELF_LIFE_POST_TRANSFER_DAYS | 14 | Min remaining shelf life after redistribution |
| TRANSFER_BUFFER_DAYS | 5 | Buffer days subtracted from expiry for transfer feasibility |
| MARKDOWN_ENABLED | true | Enable/disable markdown recommendations |
| MARKDOWN_TRIGGER_DAYS | 30 | Days-to-expiry threshold to trigger markdown |
| MARKDOWN_MIN_QTY | 1 | Min quantity for a markdown event to be worthwhile |
| MD_TIER_1 / MD_TIER_2 / MD_TIER_3 | 15% / 30% / 50% | Markdown % tiers by urgency |
| RTV_MIN_DAYS_REMAINING | 21 | Min days remaining to attempt vendor return |
| RTV_ESCALATION_THRESHOLD | 5000 (currency) | Financial exposure above which manual RTV negotiation is flagged |
| IBP_DATA_FRESHNESS_HOURS | 24 | Max age of IBP data before confidence is downgraded |
| HAZMAT_EXCLUDE | true | Exclude hazmat batches from standard recommendations |
| CURRENCY | USD | Report currency |
| PLANTS | All | Plant codes in scope (comma-separated, or "All") |
| STORAGE_TYPES_IN_SCOPE | All | EWM storage types to include |
| ACTION_TYPES_ENABLED | 1,2,3,4,5 | Subset of action types to activate |
